      "text": [
        "Founded on one simple belief: every child deserves to feel capable.",
        "Sensphere was founded by a HCPC-registered paediatric occupational therapist with over a decade of experience supporting children and young people in clinics, schools and homes across the UK. We take a warm, play-based approach rooted in evidence, always working in close partnership with the people ",
        "Every assessment and therapy plan is individual. We don't believe in one-size-fits-all programmes, we believe in listening carefully, setting meaningful goals, and celebrating progress at whatever pace it comes.",
        "10+ Years Experience"
      ]
    },
