        "Frequently asked questions",
        "No. Parents and carers can self-refer directly to Sensphere. We also accept referrals from GPs, paediatricians, schools and other professionals.",
        "We support children and young people aged 3 to 18, adapting our approach for each stage of development.",
        "We offer appointments at our clinic, in the family home, or within school settings, depending on what best suits your child's needs.",
